<title>USA: Malibu Entertainment Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Malibu Entertainment Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ALPHARETTA, Ga. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended</p>
<p>							    March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	    1996</p>
<p>Total operating revenues		  7,170,920	6,996,729</p>
<p>Equity in losses of limited partnerships</p>
<p>						   (24,691)	 (72,368)</p>
<p>Loss before benefit for income taxes and</p>
<p>non recurring (expenses) income</p>
<p>						(3,866,620)    (4,224,032)</p>
<p>Non recurring (expenses) income	  (66,438)	  847,549</p>
<p>Loss before benefit for income taxes</p>
<p>						(3,933,058)    (3,376,483)</p>
<p>Benefit for income taxes			   --	1,256,674</p>
<p>Net loss				   $(3,933,058)   $(2,119,809)</p>
<p>Net loss applicable to common stock</p>
<p>	Net loss			    (3,933,058)   $(2,119,809)</p>
<p>Less: Preferred stock dividends		 --	 (402,818)</p>
<p>Net loss applicable to common stock</p>
<p>					     $(3,933,058)   $(2,522,627)</p>
<p>Net loss per share of common stock	$(0.14)	  $(0.23)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares of</p>
<p>common stock and common stock equivalents</p>
<p>used in calculating net loss per share</p>
<p>						 28,896,467     10,966,810</p>
<p>NOTE:  Malibu Entertainment Worldwide Inc said its first quarter 1997 consolidated results of operations of the company are lower than the comparable 1996 quarter principally due to an income tax benefit and a profit on the sale of a parcel of land which were recorded in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
